        "<a href=\"https://www.atlassian.com/agile/project-management/workflow-automation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Atlassian, What is workflow automation?</a>: automating business processes, tasks and workflows with minimal human intervention.": "<a href=\"https://www.atlassian.com/agile/project-management/workflow-automation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Atlassian, What is workflow automation?</a>: automatizar procesos de negocio, tareas y flujos de trabajo con una intervención humana mínima.",
        "<a href=\"https://www.ibm.com/think/topics/workflow-automation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">IBM, What is workflow automation?</a>: replacing manual tasks with software that executes all or part of a process.": "<a href=\"https://www.ibm.com/think/topics/workflow-automation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">IBM, What is workflow automation?</a>: sustituir tareas manuales por un software que ejecuta todo o parte de un proceso.",
        "<a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/power-platform/products/power-automate/topics/workflow-automation/workflow-automation-software-and-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Microsoft, What are workflow automation tools and software?</a>: tools that automate manual processes and repetitive tasks with rule-based logic.": "<a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/power-platform/products/power-automate/topics/workflow-automation/workflow-automation-software-and-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Microsoft, What are workflow automation tools and software?</a>: herramientas que automatizan procesos manuales y tareas repetitivas con lógica basada en reglas.",
        "<a href=\"https://www.netsuite.com/portal/resource/articles/erp/workflow-automation.shtml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NetSuite, What is workflow automation?</a>: software that handles routine processes such as data entry, document delivery and task routing without manual intervention.": "<a href=\"https://www.netsuite.com/portal/resource/articles/erp/workflow-automation.shtml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NetSuite, What is workflow automation?</a>: un software que se ocupa de procesos rutinarios como la entrada de datos, la entrega de documentos y el enrutamiento de tareas, sin intervención manual.",
        "<a href=\"https://www.ricoh-usa.com/en/insights/articles/what-is-workflow-automation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ricoh USA, Workflow automation: definition, types, and more</a>: software that takes over repetitive tasks from manual labor, for more speed and accuracy.": "<a href=\"https://www.ricoh-usa.com/en/insights/articles/what-is-workflow-automation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ricoh USA, Workflow automation: definition, types, and more</a>: un software que asume las tareas repetitivas del trabajo manual, con más rapidez y precisión.",
